OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhite House pulls Tetris-style 'Build
OL,4,AThe Wall' game after copyright concern
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe White House has not responded to
OL,7,Frequests for comment from the BBC or
OL,8,Fgiven an official reason for the
OL,9,Ftakedown.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
